WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.790
Mumbai. A coastal megacity where the nights are heating faster than the days.

2
00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:10.570
Mumbai gained fifteen very warm nights a summer over the last decade.

3
00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:14.240
Its climate plan names urban heat as a priority.

4
00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:18.740
Cool nights are protection too.
